      }
    ],
    "recommended_actions": [
      "attachment_reference_shape_remediation",
      "correct_nested_arguments",
      "disable_blind_send_retries",
      "request_reproduction"
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Telemetry includes a direct failing cedar request and comparison metrics, but not a broad sample of every failed request in the incident window.",
      "The empty cedar log search for plain-text sends cannot prove absence of successful plain-text sends; tenant comparison and complaint suggest attachment-specific impact but do not fully enumerate all success cases.",
